  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></math> and <math><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">&#160;</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></math> be defined by <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> . Then <math><mi>f</mi></math> is -",
